                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W6117700                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  BINNAT UNDER VECKAN FÖR NDC:ERNA.                     *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  KENT JEBSEN                                           *        
*                                                                      *        
*  ÄNDRING    :                                                        *        
*                                                                      *        
*     DATUM       NAMN                     AVDELNING                   *        
*     ......      ..................       ......                      *        
*     ......      ..................       ......                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
FILE W61177D1                                                                   
%W93001    'KURS-'                                                              
                                                                                
FILE W61177D2                                                                   
%W6111001  'IN-'                                                                
*                                                                               
FILE TMPFIL1 FB (26 0) VIRTUAL RETAIN                                           
TMP1-IDDC        1 2 A                                                          
TMP1-IDLOPNRM    3 5 P                                                          
TMP1-KVINLART    8 4 P 0                                                        
TMP1-PRARTSTD   12 5 P 2                                                        
TMP1-TIINLMOT   17 4 P                                                          
TMP1-TIUPPDAT   21 4 P                                                          
TMP1-KDINLPRIO  25 2 N                                                          
*                                                                               
* BINNAT/WEEK                                                                   
FILE W61177D3  PRINTER VB (125 0)                                               
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
%WORKAREA                                                                       
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
%WDATKORT                                                                       
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
%WDATAREA                                                                       
NEWPAGE                                                                         
PAGE                    W  8 A VALUE '    PAGE'                                 
JA                      W  1 A VALUE 'J'                                        
NEJ                     W  1 A VALUE 'N'                                        
FOERSTA                 W  1 A VALUE 'J'                                        
WORKDAY                 W  8 A VALUE 'WORKDAY '                                 
WDATKONV                W  8 A VALUE 'WDATKONV'                                 
WS-KURS-USD             W  4 N 2                                                
WS-KURS-CAD             W  4 N 2                                                
FL-FOERSTA-CAN          W  1 A   VALUE 'J'                                      
FL-FOERSTA-USA          W  1 A   VALUE 'J'                                      
*                                                                               
PGM-NAMN    W  6  A  VALUE 'W61177'                                             
DATKORT-ID  W  6  A  VALUE 'WDATUM'                                             
*                                                                               
W-DATUM        W  6 N                                                           
W-AA W-DATUM      2 N                                                           
W-MM W-DATUM +2   2 N                                                           
W-DD W-DATUM +4   2 N                                                           
*                                                                               
W-VECKA        W  4 N                                                           
W-AA-V W-VECKA    2 N                                                           
W-VV W-VECKA +2   2 N                                                           
*                                                                               
SPAR-IDDC               W  2 A VALUE '  '                                       
SPAR-IDLOPNRM           W  8 N                                                  
W-R32-ANTAL             W  7 N 0                                                
W-R32-VARDE             W 11 N 2                                                
W-R32-ANTAL-RADER       W  7 N 0                                                
W-R32-ANTAL-RADER-PRIO  W  7 N 0                                                
W-R32-ANTAL-DAGAR       W  7 N 0                                                
W-R32-ANTAL-DAGAR-PRIO  W  7 N 0                                                
*                                                                               
LST-R32-TID-TOT         W   4  N 1                                              
LST-R32-TID-PRIO        W   5  N 1                                              
LST-R32-ANTAL           W   9  N 0                                              
LST-R32-VARDE           W  10  N 0                                              
*                                                                               
*    --- VALID IDDC CODES                                                       
*                                                                               
%WWDC99                                                                         
*                                                                               
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
* STEG 1. HÄMTAR VALUTAKURSER                                                   
*                                                                               
*** HÄMTAR AKTUELLA VALUTA-KURSER FÖR USA OCH CANADA                            
JOB INPUT W61177D1                                                              
IF KURS-SAP-KDVALISO = 'CAD' AND FL-FOERSTA-CAN = 'J'                           
   WS-KURS-CAD    = KURS-SAP-PRKURS                                             
   FL-FOERSTA-CAN = 'N'                                                         
END-IF                                                                          
IF KURS-SAP-KDVALISO = 'USD' AND FL-FOERSTA-USA = 'J'                           
   WS-KURS-USD    = KURS-SAP-PRKURS                                             
   FL-FOERSTA-USA = 'N'                                                         
END-IF                                                                          
*                                                                               
* STEG 2. SELEKTERAR INFILEN                                                    
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT W61177D2 START A-INIT                                                 
                                                                                
  PERFORM S23-CHECK-IN-IDDC                                                     
  IF IN-FLKLAR = JA AND IN-IDLOPNRM GT +0                                       
    IF IN-IDDC = NDC-NA NDC-PACIFIC NDC-AE                                      
      DAT-KDDATFORM = 'AAMMDD'                                                  
      DAT-I-TIDATUM = IN-ART-TIUPPDAT                                           
                                                                                
      CALL WDATKONV USING (DAT-KDDATFORM, +                                     
                           DAT-I-TIDATUM, +                                     
                           DAT-O-TIDATUM, +                                     
                           DAT-KDSVAR)                                          
                                                                                
      IF DAT-KDSVAR = ' '                                                       
        IF DAT-TIAAVV-GRP = W-VECKA                                             
          TMP1-IDDC      = IN-IDDC                                              
          TMP1-IDLOPNRM  = IN-IDLOPNRM                                          
          TMP1-KVINLART  = IN-KVINLART                                          
          TMP1-PRARTSTD  = IN-PRARTSTD                                          
          TMP1-TIINLMOT  = IN-TIINLMOT                                          
          TMP1-TIUPPDAT  = IN-ART-TIUPPDAT                                      
          TMP1-KDINLPRIO = IN-RAD-KDINLPRIO                                     
          PUT TMPFIL1                                                           
        END-IF                                                                  
      END-IF                                                                    
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
*                                                                               
A-INIT. PROC                                                                    
   CALL DATKORT USING (PGM-NAMN DATKORT-ID DATUMKORT)                           
   W-AA    = D-AAR                                                              
   W-MM    = D-MAANAD                                                           
   W-DD    = D-DAG                                                              
   W-AA-V  = D-AAR                                                              
   W-VV    = D-VECKA                                                            
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
*    --- S23-CHECK-IN-IDDC (MACRO PROCEDURE)                                    
%WWDC02 'IN-'                                                                   
*                                                                               
* STEG 3. SORTERAR TEMPORÄRFILEN                                                
*                                                                               
SORT TMPFIL1 TO TMPFIL1 USING (TMP1-IDDC, TMP1-IDLOPNRM)                        
*                                                                               
* STEG 4. BEHANDLAR OCH SKRIVER LISTAN                                          
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT TMPFIL1 FINISH Z-FINIT                                                
                                                                                
IF FOERSTA = JA                                                                 
   SPAR-IDDC     = TMP1-IDDC                                                    
   SPAR-IDLOPNRM = +0                                                           
   FOERSTA       = NEJ                                                          
END-IF                                                                          
IF TMP1-IDDC NE SPAR-IDDC                                                       
   PERFORM S23-CHECK-SPAR-IDDC                                                  
   PERFORM D-PRINTA-LISTA                                                       
   SPAR-IDDC                    = TMP1-IDDC                                     
   W-R32-ANTAL                  = +0                                            
   W-R32-VARDE                  = +0                                            
   W-R32-ANTAL-RADER            = +0                                            
   W-R32-ANTAL-RADER-PRIO       = +0                                            
   W-R32-ANTAL-DAGAR            = +0                                            
   W-R32-ANTAL-DAGAR-PRIO       = +0                                            
END-IF                                                                          
IF TMP1-IDLOPNRM NE SPAR-IDLOPNRM                                               
  W-R32-ANTAL       = W-R32-ANTAL + +1                                          
  W-R32-ANTAL-RADER = W-R32-ANTAL-RADER + +1                                    
  PERFORM B-BERAKNA-DAGAR                                                       
END-IF                                                                          
IF TMP1-KDINLPRIO LT 20                                                         
  W-R32-ANTAL-RADER-PRIO = W-R32-ANTAL-RADER-PRIO + +1                          
END-IF                                                                          
W-R32-VARDE   = W-R32-VARDE + (TMP1-KVINLART * TMP1-PRARTSTD)                   
SPAR-IDLOPNRM = TMP1-IDLOPNRM                                                   
*                                                                               
B-BERAKNA-DAGAR. PROC                                                           
  WORK-KDCALL = 001                                                             
  WORK-IDDC   = SPAR-IDDC                                                       
  WORK-TIAAMMDD-FOM = TMP1-TIINLMOT                                             
  WORK-TIAAMMDD-TOM = TMP1-TIUPPDAT                                             
  CALL WORKDAY USING (WORK-KDCALL        +                                      
                      WORK-DATE-AREA     +                                      
                      WORK-KDSVAR)                                              
  IF WORK-KDSVAR = ' '                                                          
    W-R32-ANTAL-DAGAR = W-R32-ANTAL-DAGAR + WORK-KVWORKD                        
    IF TMP1-KDINLPRIO LT 20                                                     
      W-R32-ANTAL-DAGAR-PRIO = W-R32-ANTAL-DAGAR-PRIO + WORK-KVWORKD            
    END-IF                                                                      
  ELSE                                                                          
    DISPLAY 'FEL FRÅN WORKDAY '                                                 
  END-IF                                                                        
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
                                                                                
                                                                                
D-PRINTA-LISTA.      PROC                                                       
  IF W-R32-ANTAL-RADER = 0                                                      
     W-R32-ANTAL-RADER = 1                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
  LST-R32-TID-TOT  = W-R32-ANTAL-DAGAR / W-R32-ANTAL-RADER                      
  IF W-R32-ANTAL-RADER-PRIO = 0                                                 
     W-R32-ANTAL-RADER-PRIO = 1                                                 
  END-IF                                                                        
  LST-R32-TID-PRIO = W-R32-ANTAL-DAGAR-PRIO / W-R32-ANTAL-RADER-PRIO            
  LST-R32-ANTAL    = W-R32-ANTAL                                                
  IF SPAR-IDDC = NDC-US                                                         
     LST-R32-VARDE = W-R32-VARDE / WS-KURS-USD                                  
  ELSE                                                                          
     IF SPAR-IDDC = NDC-CA                                                      
        LST-R32-VARDE = W-R32-VARDE / WS-KURS-CAD                               
     ELSE                                                                       
        LST-R32-VARDE = W-R32-VARDE                                             
     END-IF                                                                     
  END-IF                                                                        
  PRINT W61177                                                                  
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
Z-FINIT. PROC                                                                   
  IF FOERSTA = NEJ                                                              
    PERFORM D-PRINTA-LISTA                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
*    --- S23-CHECK-SPAR-IDDC (MACRO PROCEDURE)                                  
%WWDC02 'SPAR-'                                                                 
                                                                                
*                                                                               
REPORT W61177                 +                                                 
       PRINTER W61177D3       +                                                 
       LINESIZE 120           +                                                 
       SPACE 0                +                                                 
       NOHEADING              +                                                 
       NOSPREAD               +                                                 
       NOADJUST               +                                                 
       NODATE                                                                   
                                                                                
LINE  1  LST-R32-TID-TOT LST-R32-TID-PRIO                     +                 
         LST-R32-ANTAL   LST-R32-VARDE                                          
BEFORE-LINE. PROC                                                               
*                                                                               
   DISPLAY '¤DAPW61177'                                                         
   DISPLAY '¤DAP' SPAR-IDDC                                                     
   DISPLAY '            VOLVO CAR PARTS         W61177   '      +               
           'BINNED WEEK:' W-VECKA ' LOCAL RECEIVING      DC '   +               
            SPAR-IDDC                                                           
                                                                                
   DISPLAY ' AVERAGE TIME IN DAYS         BINNED'                               
   IF SPAR-IDDC = NDC-US                                                        
      DISPLAY 'TOTAL    PRIO     QTY MR     VALUE USD'                          
   ELSE                                                                         
      IF SPAR-IDDC = NDC-CA                                                     
         DISPLAY 'TOTAL    PRIO     QTY MR     VALUE CAD'                       
      ELSE                                                                      
         DISPLAY 'TOTAL    PRIO     QTY MR     VALUE SEK'                       
      END-IF                                                                    
   END-IF                                                                       
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
                                                                                
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
